:20%;\"><img alt=\"技能 七手八脚的分工合作.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/0d/id0aevp7f09ethulmgvjn5wkgxpfu7e.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E4%B8%83%E6%89%8B%E5%85%AB%E8%84%9A%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E5%B7%A5%E5%90%88%E4%BD%9C.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/0d/id0aevp7f09ethulmgvjn5wkgxpfu7e.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E4%B8%83%E6%89%8B%E5%85%AB%E8%84%9A%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E5%B7%A5%E5%90%88%E4%BD%9C.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/0d/id0aevp7f09ethulmgvjn5wkgxpfu7e.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />七手八脚的分工合作\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[职业技能]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（被动）拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"后备隐藏脂肪\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">后备隐藏脂肪</font></span></span>]时，攻防属性提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>、远程技能的最大射程和移动力增加<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格。在[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"后备隐藏脂肪\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">后备隐藏脂肪</font></span></span>]达到<font color=\"#ed7950\">5</font>层时，所有效果翻倍。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%B5%81%E6%98%9F%E9%98%9F\" title=\"角色图鉴库/流星队\"><img alt=\"头像 流星队.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/36/fyegbun96i4fodf5glhu8cus4z2ug7t.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"